/ La fiche d'un point de commentaire (epic #348, phase 11) : le fil, la
  réponse inline, « Marquer comme résolu » / « Rouvrir ». Même enveloppe que
  la fiche d'un objet (`_feature_panel`) : la carte la montre, la cache, et
  recharge la bulle du point quand `data-feature-saved` est posé.
- saved = local_assigns[:saved]
- root = feature.map_comments.roots.first
div[class="pointer-events-auto flex h-full flex-col bg-white shadow-2xl md:rounded-xl md:border md:border-stone-200"
    data-feature-panel="true"
    data-comment-panel="true"
    data-feature-id=feature.id
    data-layer-id=feature.map_layer_id
    data-feature-saved=(saved ? "true" : nil)]
  .flex.items-center.gap-2.border-b.border-stone-100.px-4.py-3
    span class="rounded-full bg-forest-tint px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-forest"
      | Commentaire
    h2.flex-1.truncate.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-800
      = root ? "Fil de #{root.author.display_name}" : "Commentaire"
    - if root&.resolved_at
      span[class="rounded-full bg-stone-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-600"
           data-comment-resolved="true"
           title="Résolu le #{map_comment_exact_time(root.resolved_at)}"]
        | Résolu
    button[type="button" class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 hover:text-stone-700"
           data-action="click->map#closePanel" aria-label="Fermer la fiche"]
      svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
        line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"
        line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"

  .flex-1.overflow-y-auto.px-4.py-4
    - if root
      ol.space-y-4 id=dom_id(root, :messages) data-comment-thread=root.id
        = render partial: "maps/comment_message", collection: root.thread.to_a, as: :comment
      .mt-5
        = render "maps/comment_reply_form", root: root
    - else
      p.text-sm.text-stone-500 Ce point n'a plus de message.

  - if root
    .flex.items-center.gap-2.border-t.border-stone-100.px-4.py-3
      - if root.resolved_at
        = button_to "Rouvrir", reopen_map_comment_path(root),
                    class: "h-11 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-50",
                    data: { comment_action: "reopen" }
      - else
        = button_to "Marquer comme résolu", resolve_map_comment_path(root),
                    class: "h-11 rounded-lg bg-forest px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90",
                    data: { comment_action: "resolve" }
